 "scope": "Structure only: effect IDs, words per channel, channel counts and which word indexes the device changed when converting FW10 0x013E to FW13 0x0146. No parameter values are stored.",
 "findings": [
  "Grid/scene prefix (bytes 0..4609), record order and the system tail are byte-identical after conversion.",
  "A record header changes only in its words field (offset 42).",
  "Blocks whose word count is unchanged keep every word unless the FW13 range/scale of that word changed (re-scaled by the device).",
  "Grown blocks keep words 0..old-1 and get the new words appended at the end of each channel."
 ],
